Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Load cemetery names and photos from the live kaddish
 people API.

The cemetery page now reads the public Novosibirsk registry at runtime, with the bundled JSON kept as an offline fallback.
---
 lib/data/kaddish.dart               | 147 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 lib/data/repository.dart            | 123 +++++++++++------------
 lib/data/snapshot.dart              |   2 +
 lib/models.dart                     |   2 +
